{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1356886-the-squall-roc-and-city-of-vasana-white-elephant-for-brilliantrain","id":1356886,"title":"The Squall Roc and City of Vasana [White Elephant for BrilliantRain]","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-12-24T19:45:59-08:00","id":1356886,"title":"The Squall Roc and City of Vasana [White Elephant for BrilliantRain]","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BrilliantRain</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1350958-the-ninth-annual-exalted-white-elephant?p=1352185#post1352185\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh, this is always fun. I\u2019ll go ahead and join in.<br /> <br /> I\u2019d like something Lunar related, sorcery related, or artifact related (or some or all of the above). Bonus points if it\u2019s transformative in some way or explores the consequences of whatever that thing is existing in the world.</div> </div> </div> </div>I decided to create a city that was shaped in its distant past by the artifice of a Lunar sorcerer!<br /> <br /> The city of <b>Vasana</b> has bent the knee to the Dragon-Blooded of Prasad only recently. The Kamthahar clans' dreams of imperialism had not touched it until three years ago, but now the city is in peril. In ages long past, it is said that an Anathema sorcerer cursed Vasana; he summoned a terrible creature, and called on it to destroy the city. Each year, during the three nights of the new moon in Resplendent Air, a creature materializes over the city, the Squall Roc. The storm behemoth spreads its wings wide enough to hide the sky, and rampages through the city until the sun rises. The Squall Roc's rampage is slow enough that deaths seldom occur as a result of its assaults, but even the prince's palace is not fortified enough to withstand its devastating onslaught.<br /> <br /> A mere three years ago, the Squall Roc could be forced into quiescence by a ritual in which the citizens of Vasana came together, and the greatest storyteller among them would speak the Six-and-Sixty Words that send the monster into torpor for a year. Now, however, they have no storyteller - she was killed for protesting against Prasad's presence in their lands - and the Dragon-Blooded attempts to repel the Squall Roc are a poor substitute. Even if they manage to kill it one night, the Squall Roc rises again the next night and begins its rampage anew.<br /> <br /> Some Vasana are convinced the Anathema who cursed them lives still, and could be persuaded to revoke his curse; others pore through the city's archives, hoping against hope that some record of the Six-and-Sixty Words might be found inside; a few contemplate turning to the sorcerers of Ysyr for aid.<br /> <br /> \u200b<div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">In truth, the Squall Roc is formed from the negativity of the Vasana people. In the First Age a Lunar sorcerer set a great moonsilver mirror under the city, and each year the mirror takes in the shadows cast by the people's darkest thoughts, and forges them into a new Squall Roc. The Lunar also created the ritual of the Six-and-Sixty Words, which discorporates the Squall Roc, and in doing so, weakens the negative Ties and Principles formed by the Vasana each year.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> \u200b","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 12-24-2019, 11:01 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-26T09:01:01-08:00","id":1357054,"title":"","content":"Yep - Reminds me of a DS9 Episode and the Dalroc... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> I like it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">The problem with defending the purity of the English language is that English is about as pure as a cribhouse whore. We don't just borrow words; on occasion, English has pursued other languages down alleyways to beat them unconscious and rifle their pockets for new vocabulary. - James. D. Nicoll</span></span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/540-tymeaus-jalynsfein","name":"Tymeaus Jalynsfein","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-28T08:34:58-08:00","id":1357367,"title":"","content":"I like it. Neat idea and a nice little twist.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-28T16:21:40-08:00","id":1357424,"title":"","content":"I like it enough that I'll probably use it in a game down the line","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malfeas F'Tagn - go check out my epic MLP/Exalted crossover &quot;The Scroll of Exalted ponies&quot; @ Fimfiction","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/588-webkilla","name":"webkilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar588_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-29T03:06:07-08:00","id":1357496,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_conta